admng-openwec for AdMng Watchdog
================================

OpenWEC receives the Windows Event Forwarding of the domain controllers for AdMng
Watchdog. Configuration: /etc/openwec.conf.toml (hostname and Kerberos service
principal of the Watchdog server). The subscription is generated by
"admng-watchdog print-wec-subscription" and loaded from
/etc/openwec/subscriptions/admng-dc-security.toml – keep no other file in that
directory. The DC addresses allowed to connect go to the drop-in
/etc/systemd/system/openwecd.service.d/admng-dcs.conf (IPAddressAllow=).

Full instructions: docs/WATCHDOG-LINUX.md of AD_MNG (chapter 4).
